  "prefLabel": "Rev 2902.06 Preparer tax identification number",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2902.06 “Preparer tax identification number” means a tax processing number issued by the Internal Revenue Service to enrolled agents and tax preparers.\n\nSource. #8389, eff 7-8-05; ss by #10388, eff 7-25-13, renumbered by #10885 (from Rev 2902.05); ss by #13660, eff 6-21-23",
